#
# Findings the Trivy scan of the supply-chain workflow accepts (ADR-0009).
# Every entry has an expiry date and belongs to a block that opens with a
# comment giving the reason; .github/scripts/check-trivyignore.sh fails the
# run otherwise, and once a date has passed. An entry applies to every image
# scanned. See docs/architecture/supply-chain.md.
#
#   # <reason>
#   <vulnerability id> exp:YYYY-MM-DD

# postgres: Go standard library in /usr/local/bin/gosu, which drops root once
# at container start. gosu calls none of the affected packages and does not
# rebuild for such CVEs (https://github.com/tianon/gosu/security).
